==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|box|en|t2=plural}}

A nonstandard plural of {{term|box}} formed by analogy with {{term|oxen}}. The standard plural of ''box'' is {{term|boxes}}; ''-en'' is no longer a plural in standard use. See ''[[-en#Etymology 2|-en]]'' for details.

===Noun===
'''boxen''' {{p}}
the thing u say when someone dose somthing stupid

